{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out for gatherings, private sessions, and collaboration. A calm contact page for arranging sound-led pauses.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1724;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--accent:#8be9d8;--muted:#a6b0c3;--card:#0b1220;--shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.7);--glass-border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#e6eef6;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071025 0%,#051226 60%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    body::after{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');opacity:0.06;mix-blend-mode:screen}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px;}
    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6fb1ff);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#042;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;transition:all .18s}
    .nav-links a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}

    .hero{margin-top:26px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:28px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border:var(--glass-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px}
    .hero h1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#f3fbff}
    .hero p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
    .hero .cta{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7fd1ff);color:#052126;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px}

    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),var(--glass-2));padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:var(--glass-border)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Two-column content under hero */
    .left{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
    .right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}

    /* Proof Gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{min-height:80px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .quote{font-size:15px;color:#eaf8ff}
    .author{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);position:relative}
    .badge[data-tip]:hover::after{content:attr(data-tip);position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#021323;color:#cfeff3;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}

    /* Mixer */
    .mixer{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .levels{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .level{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);text-align:center;cursor:pointer}
    .level input{display:none}
    .level.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(139,233,216,0.12),rgba(127,209,255,0.08));border-color:rgba(139,233,216,0.18)}
    .recommendations{margin-top:8px;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .program{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:8px 6px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .program:last-child{border-bottom:none}
    .program .name{font-weight:600}
    .price{color:var(--muted)}

    /* Contact form */
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:#eaf8ff}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}

    /* Footer CTA */
    .final-cta{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}.right{order:2}.left{order:1}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:#eaf8ff">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="events.html">Next</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">For You</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">Origins</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="btn">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="ghost">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="left">
        <h1 id="hero-heading">Reach out and tune the next pause</h1>
        <p class="muted">Whether arranging a small gathering, a private reset, or a workplace pause, leave a line and we will answer with time, tone, and place suggestions.</p>

        <div class="card">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div class="muted">Preferred sonic intensity</div>
              <div class="mixer" id="mixer">
                <div class="levels">
                  <label class="level" data-level="gentle"><input type="radio" name="level" value="gentle">Gentle</label>
                  <label class="level" data-level="medium"><input type="radio" name="level" value="medium">Medium</label>
                  <label class="level" data-level="intense"><input type="radio" name="level" value="intense">Intense</label>
                </div>
                <div class="recommendations card" id="recommendations" aria-live="polite">
                  <!-- Filled by JS -->
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="width:120px;text-align:right">
              <div class="muted">Quick book</div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card proof" aria-live="polite">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div class="muted">Voices from recent gatherings</div>
              <div class="testimonial" id="testimonial"> <!-- Rotating testimonial -->
                <!-- Filled by JS -->
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="muted">Recognition</div>
              <div class="badges" id="badges">
                <!-- Badges inserted by JS -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside class="right">
        <div class="card">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div class="muted">Contact options</div>
              <div style="font-weight:700;color:#f3fbff;margin-top:6px">Speak or write</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="muted">Phone</div>
              <div style="font-weight:700;color:#f3fbff">{{PHONE}}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="muted">Prefer email? Send a short note and we will reply within 48 hours.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <a class="btn" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call</a>
            <a class="ghost" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="muted">Quick inquiry</div>
          <form id="contact-form">
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
            <label class="muted" for="session-for">Looking for</label>
            <select id="session-for">
              <option value="group">A community gathering</option>
              <option value="private">A private session</option>
              <option value="corporate">A workplace pause</option>
              <option value="other">Other / consult</option>
            </select>
            <textarea id="message" placeholder="A few lines about what you need (date, rough size, intention)"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Send request</button>
              <button type="button" id="pref-copy" class="ghost">Copy preference</button>
            </div>
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">We reply with scheduling options and a tailored sound plan. If a session is contraindicated we will suggest alternatives.</div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card muted" style="font-size:13px">
          Contraindications: If you have epilepsy, uncontrolled high blood pressure, recent head trauma, or pregnancy concerns, please consult a clinician before attending. Inform us of any concerns when booking.
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:18px">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#eaf8ff">How we arrange a session</h3>
        <div class="muted">A short outline so you know what to expect when we coordinate: tone, size, and flow.</div>
        <ol style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)">
          <li><strong>Connect:</strong> We clarify date, attendance, and intention.</li>
          <li><strong>Design:</strong> We propose a palette (soft/gentle, steady/medium, deep/intense) tailored to the group.</li>
          <li><strong>Gather:</strong> We arrive early to shape the space and welcome everyone.</li>
          <li><strong>Return:</strong> A closing transition and practical notes for aftercare.</li>
        </ol>
        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="muted">Pricing is hybrid — there's a suggested tier with room for sliding contribution for community access.</div>
      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#eaf8ff">Need a curated program?</h4>
        <div class="muted">Pick an intensity and we show program suggestions you can book directly.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px" id="mini-recs">
          <!-- Mirrors main recommendations for quick glance -->
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:20px" class="card">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#eaf8ff">Questions we often answer</h3>
      <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary class="muted">What should I bring?</summary><div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">A mat, a blanket, and an openness to sit or lie. We keep the space calm and warm.</div></details>
      <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary class="muted">Who benefits from these sessions?</summary><div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">People seeking a pause, teams needing recalibration, or hosts offering a composed moment for guests. If in doubt, ask and we will advise.</div></details>
      <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary class="muted">Are there home-practice notes?</summary><div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Yes — small takeaways and breathing cues are offered after most gatherings.</div></details>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
      <div class="muted">Prefer to reserve a time directly? Use our booking flow for available slots in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</div>
      <div class="final-cta">
        <a class="btn" href="book.html">Reserve time</a>
        <a class="ghost" href="events.html">See next events</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer style="margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — small gatherings, careful sound. Contact: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a></footer>

  </div>

  <script>
    // Data for mixer and recommendations
    const programs = {
      gentle: [
        {name: 'Sway — Soft Room', desc: 'A cushioned hour for gentle breathing and harmonic bowls.', price: 'Suggested $40–70 / person'},
        {name: 'Pulse Pause — Short', desc: 'A 30-minute sitting to soften attention and restore ease.', price: 'Suggested $25 / person'}
      ],
      medium: [
        {name: 'Tide — Steady Field', desc: 'An hour with tuned gongs and guided transitions.', price: 'Suggested $60–100 / person'},
        {name: 'Gather Reset', desc: 'A workshop-style session with grounding prompts and sound.', price: 'Suggested $80 / group'}
      ],
      intense: [
        {name: 'Deep Resonance — Intensive', desc: 'Extended tone work for deeper release and integration.', price: 'Suggested $150 / person or tiered group options'},
        {name: 'Resonant Night', desc: 'A longer evening practice with sustained harmonics.', price: 'Invite-only pricing - enquire'}
      ]
    };

    // Initial state
    let activeLevel = 'medium';

    // DOM refs
    const recEl = document.getElementById('recommendations');
    const miniRecs = document.getElementById('mini-recs');
    const tester = document.getElementById('testimonial');
    const badgesEl = document.getElementById('badges');

    // Mixer buttons
    document.querySelectorAll('.level').forEach(el => {
      el.addEventListener('click', () => {
        document.querySelectorAll('.level').forEach(l=>l.classList.remove('active'));
        el.classList.add('active');
        activeLevel = el.getAttribute('data-level');
        renderRecommendations();
        renderMini();
      });
    });

    // Render functions
    function renderRecommendations(){
      const list = programs[activeLevel];
      recEl.innerHTML = '';
      list.forEach(p => {
        const node = document.createElement('div');
        node.className = 'program';
        node.innerHTML = '<div><div class="name">'+escapeHtml(p.name)+'</div><div class="muted">'+escapeHtml(p.desc)+'</div></div><div class="price">'+escapeHtml(p.price)+'</div>';
        recEl.appendChild(node);
      });
      // CTA suggestion
      recEl.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<div style="margin-top:10px;text-align:right"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Book this tone</a></div>');
    }

    function renderMini(){
      const list = programs[activeLevel];
      miniRecs.innerHTML = '';
      list.forEach(p=>{
        const d = document.createElement('div');
        d.style.marginBottom='8px';
        d.innerHTML = '<div style="font-weight:700;color:#eaf8ff">'+escapeHtml(p.name)+'</div><div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">'+escapeHtml(p.price)+'</div>';
        miniRecs.appendChild(d);
      });
    }

    // Simple escaping for insertion
    function escapeHtml(s){ return String(s).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/"/g,'&quot;').replace(/'/g,'&#39;'); }

    // Testimonials + badges
    const testimonials = [
      {quote: 'The sound held space for quiet decisions.' , person: 'M. (community host)'},
      {quote: 'A balanced hour — practical rest afterwards.', person: 'R. (designer)'},
      {quote: 'Gentle but precise. Our team felt steady.', person: 'T. (manager)'}
    ];

    const badges = [
      {label:'Verified Host', tip:'Consistent five-star session reviews across local listings.'},
      {label:'Community Access', tip:'Sliding contributions to keep community spots available.'},
      {label:'Safety Protocols', tip:'Pre-screened contraindication guidance and care notes.'}
    ];

    // Rotator
    let tIndex=0;
    function rotateTestimonial(){
      const t = testimonials[tIndex % testimonials.length];
      tester.innerHTML = '<div style="flex:1"><div class="quote">\u201C'+escapeHtml(t.quote)+'\u201D</div><div class="author">— '+escapeHtml(t.person)+'</div></div>';
      tIndex++;
    }

    function renderBadges(){
      badgesEl.innerHTML = '';
      badges.forEach(b=>{
        const el = document.createElement('div');
        el.className='badge';
        el.setAttribute('data-tip', b.tip);
        el.textContent = b.label;
        badgesEl.appendChild(el);
      });
    }

    // Start
    (function init(){
      // default active state
      const defaultEl = document.querySelector('.level[data-level="'+activeLevel+'"]');
      if(defaultEl) defaultEl.classList.add('active');
      renderRecommendations();
      renderMini();
      rotateTestimonial();
      renderBadges();
      setInterval(rotateTestimonial,6000);
    })();

    // Contact form logic (opens mailto for demo)
    document.getElementById('contact-form').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const sessionFor = document.getElementById('session-for').value;
      const message = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Booking inquiry from '+name+' ('+sessionFor+')');
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+name+'\nEmail: '+email+'\nType: '+sessionFor+'\n\nMessage:\n'+message+'\n\nPreferred intensity: '+activeLevel+'\n');
      // Open user's email client
      const mailto = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
      window.location.href = mailto;
    });

    // Copy preference button (copies the active intensity)
    document.getElementById('pref-copy').addEventListener('click', function(){
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText('Preferred intensity: '+activeLevel).then(()=>{
        this.textContent = 'Copied';
        setTimeout(()=>this.textContent='Copy preference',1500);
      });
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"}  
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the sound bath site (chunk 4).

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — The contact page for the site. It contains the following interactive features implemented with local JS and CSS only:
  - Sound preference mixer: choose gentle / medium / intense. The selection updates program recommendations and a small recommendation panel. It also mirrors those recommendations in a compact sidebar.
  - Proof Gallery: rotates testimonials every 6 seconds and displays credibility badges with hover tooltips.
  - Contact form: builds a mailto: link (demo-friendly). The form includes name, email, session type, message, and appends the selected intensity to the email body.
  - Contraindications disclaimer is included and visible near the form.

Placeholders present (fill these when deploying):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Design notes:
- layoutFamily: glass_morphism styling uses a minimal glass card look with a subtle SVG background pattern referenced at assets/img/pattern.svg. Provide that asset in the assets/img/ folder (unique SVG pattern for the project).
- voiceFamily: minimal_poetic — concise, quiet language on the page.
- offerModel: hybrid — the page mentions suggested tiers with room for sliding contributions.

How to test locally:
1. Open contact.html in a modern browser.
2. Try clicking the intensity boxes (Gentle / Medium / Intense) and watch recommendations change.
3. Observe the testimonial rotate every 6s; hover badges to read tooltips.
4. Fill the form and submit — it will open your mail client using mailto:{{EMAIL}} with the form contents and chosen intensity.

Notes for integration:
- Navigation links are relative and assume pages: index.html, events.html, private-sessions.html, pricing.html, about.html, faq.html, book.html, contact.html.
- Replace placeholders before publishing.
- Add assets/img/pattern.svg (unique SVG) to complete background styling.

Contraindications:
- The page contains a responsible caution about epilepsy, uncontrolled high blood pressure, recent head trauma, and pregnancy-related concerns. Keep that text intact and update per clinical guidance as needed.

